        <a href="#" class="mt-4 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-200">Read More →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-6">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-300">Culture</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold">Documentary on Street Artists Premieres</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">January 10, 2026</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-300">An in-depth look at the lives and work of street artists reshaping the urban landscape.</p>
        <a href="#" class="mt-4 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-200">Read More →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-6">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-300">Food</p>
