        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-300">Explore the vibrant street food vendors and underground restaurants making waves in the culinary world.</p>
        <a href="#" class="mt-4 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-300 hover:text-emerald-200">Read More →</a>
    </article>
</section>
{{ end }}
